One Clock (Off The Map) — third-party material and licences

Map data
- Terrain: AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen terrarium; SRTM, GMTED2010, ETOPO1 and others), free with attribution. Downloaded 2026-11-17 (data/tiles/fetch.log).
- Imagery: "Blue Marble: Land Surface, Shallow Water, and Shaded Topography", NASA Goddard Space Flight Center / NASA Visible Earth. Public domain.
  Via Wikimedia Commons, File:Whole_world_-_land_and_oceans_12000.jpg (cropped to 60–150°E, 0–60°N).
- Borders: Natural Earth 1:10m Cultural Vectors, admin 0 countries, China point of view (ne_10m_admin_0_countries_chn),
  and maritime indicator lines, China point of view (ne_10m_admin_0_boundary_lines_maritime_indicator_chn). Public domain.
- Relief exaggerated ×30 (land). Sun position computed for 21 December (NOAA approximation); see FACTS.md.

